From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: dianqk <dianqk@dianqk.net>
Date: Wed, 14 Oct 2026 22:10:35 +0800
Subject: [PATCH 18/24] configs: mediatek_mobile: reset through reset_cpu(),
 not reset_misc()

With PSCI_RESET the PSCI firmware driver's reset_misc() resets before
reset_cpu() runs, which skips the board's reset hook (saving the console
record). reset_cpu() still uses PSCI SYSTEM_RESET.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
---
 configs/mediatek_mobile_defconfig | 2 ++
 1 file changed, 2 insertions(+)

diff --git a/configs/mediatek_mobile_defconfig b/configs/mediatek_mobile_defconfig
index dee8a514327..055937133e2 100644
--- a/configs/mediatek_mobile_defconfig
+++ b/configs/mediatek_mobile_defconfig
@@ -92,3 +92,5 @@ CONFIG_WATCHDOG_TIMEOUT_MSECS=15000
 CONFIG_WDT_MTK=y
 # CONFIG_PANIC_HANG is not set
 # CONFIG_OF_UPSTREAM is not set
+# CONFIG_PSCI_RESET is not set
+CONFIG_ARM_SMCCC=y
-- 
2.55.0

